<p>Qum se aati hai sada, Aye Ghareebul Ghoraba<br />
Aye Ghareebul Ghoraba ,Aye Ghareebul Ghoraba</p>

<p>Beqata maara gaya Aye Ghareebul Ghoraba<br />
Aye Ghareebul Ghoraba ,Aye Ghareebul Ghoraba</p>

<p>1. Haaye Mamoon(l.a) ne ye kaisa sitam kardaala<br />
Ibne Ahmad ke liye Zehre Dagha Bhijwaaya<br />
Bewatan Maara gaya Aye Ghareebul Ghoraba<br />
Aye Ghareebul Ghoraba Aye Ghareebul Ghoraba</p>

<p>2. Mere bhayya main yaha'n aayi thi tumse milne<br />
ab jo tum hi na rahe kya kare behna jeeke<br />
Jeena dushwaar hua Aye Ghareebul Ghoraba<br />
Aye Ghareebul Ghoraba Aye Ghareebul Ghoraba</p>

<p>3. Kaale parcham hai lage soug me tere har su<br />
Mere bhayya main kaha'n paoongi teri khushboo<br />
Mujhko itna to bata Aye Ghareebul Ghoraba<br />
Aye Ghareebul Ghoraba Aye Ghareebul Ghoraba</p>

<p>4. Sab ke zamin ho tum aur zamin e aahoo hai laqab<br />
Aisa sam tumko mila khaate hi neele hue lab<br />
yu'n ki ummat ne dagha Aye Ghareebul Ghoraba<br />
Aye Ghareebul Ghoraba Aye Ghareebul Ghoraba</p>

<p>5. Baba Kazim(a.s) ko zaher qaid me hi bhijwaaya<br />
TUmko bhi bhai mere zehre sitam se maara<br />
Mera kuch bhi na bacha Aye Ghareebul Ghoraba<br />
Aye Ghareebul Ghoraba Aye Ghareebul Ghoraba</p>

<p>6. Tu Ghareebul Ghoraba aur main khwahar teri<br />
Ek Ghareeb aur hai karbal me churi jispa chali<br />
Na kafan usko mila Aye Ghareebul Ghoraba<br />
Aye Ghareebul Ghoraba Aye Ghareebul Ghoraba</p>

<p>7. Bhai ko rote hue Zainab e Muztar(s.a) guzri<br />
Sog me bhai tere mera bhi sar hai zaqmi<br />
Ye bahen tujhpe fida Aye Ghareebul Ghoraba<br />
Aye Ghareebul Ghoraba Aye Ghareebul Ghoraba</p>

<p>8. <b>Asghari </b> Karti hai matam tere gham me bhayya<br />
Aur <b>Mirza</b> ne tere gham me hai nouha ye likha<br />
Inko mashad tu bula Aye Ghareebul Ghoraba<br />
Aye Ghareebul Ghoraba Aye Ghareebul Ghoraba</p>
